.TH CRUNCH_EPOLL_CTL_OLD 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_epoll_ctl_old \- invokes obsolete epoll_ctl_old syscall slot 214, unimplemented on linux x86-64
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/legacy_syscalls.h>
.B int crunch_epoll_ctl_old(int epoll, int operation, int descriptor, void* event);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes obsolete epoll_ctl_old syscall slot 214, unimplemented on Linux x86-64. Seccomp or other policy may instead return a different error.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR epoll_ctl_old (2)
